{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"理查德·汉明·核心贡献","stage":"DONE","category":"richard-hamming","categoryLabel":"理查德·汉明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/06_richard-hamming/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心贡献\">核心贡献</h1><p>本卷集中阐述理查德·汉明对科学的<strong>具体技术贡献</strong>——它们&quot;是什么、怎么运作、为什么重要&quot;。汉明最著名的工作是开创纠错码理论：1950 年发表的汉明码，是历史上第一种能自动纠正单比特错误的编码，连同他提出的海明距离，共同奠定了现代信息科学的地基。在数值方法领域，他既塑造了数值分析这门学科，又留下广泛应用于信号处理的汉明窗与&quot;计算的目的在于洞察，而非数字&quot;的格言。作为早期计算的奠基者，他还对计算如何重塑科学与社会做出了深远预见。汉明凭这些工作于 1968 年获图灵奖（第三位得主）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三章\">本卷三章</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 纠错码</strong>：<a href=\"error-correcting-codes/hamming-code\">汉明码</a> 讲构造与编解码机制，<a href=\"error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance\">海明距离</a> 讲衡量纠错能力的度量。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 数值方法</strong>：<a href=\"numerical-methods/numerical-analysis\">数值分析</a> 讲学科方法与稳定性思想，<a href=\"numerical-methods/hamming-window\">汉明窗</a> 讲信号处理工具。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 计算的奠基</strong>：<a href=\"computing-foundations/early-computing\">早期计算</a> 讲实践与工程方法，<a href=\"computing-foundations/mechanizing-thought\">计算与科学的未来</a> 讲前瞻思想。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>2 核心贡献（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>贡献&quot;是什么、怎么运作&quot;</td>\n<td>技术内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他在何时何地做出这些</td>\n<td>本卷的传记背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 理念与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>如何思考与做研究</strong></td>\n<td>本卷成就背后的方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a></td>\n<td>这些贡献的<strong>著作/奖项载体</strong></td>\n<td>纠错码的产业化、教材、图灵奖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些贡献<strong>后来怎样改变世界</strong></td>\n<td>本卷成果的下游影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>对其人其思的批评与平衡评价</td>\n<td>客观视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>边界约定：本卷只展开&quot;机制本身&quot;。同一事实只在主篇深入——例如纠错码的产业应用归 <a href=\"../major-works/hamming-codes-legacy/applications\">4 主要著作</a>，研究哲学归 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 理念与方法</a>，本卷仅做交叉链接，不重复展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：二进制与异或运算、基础线性代数；汉明窗篇另需傅里叶变换/FFT 常识。</li>\n<li><strong>路径</strong>：先读 <a href=\"error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance\">海明距离</a>（建立&quot;距离决定纠错能力&quot;的直觉）→ 再读 <a href=\"error-correcting-codes/hamming-code\">汉明码</a>（看它如何被构造出来）→ 然后 <a href=\"numerical-methods/numerical-analysis\">数值分析</a> 与 <a href=\"numerical-methods/hamming-window\">汉明窗</a>（应用数学一脉）→ 最后 <a href=\"computing-foundations/early-computing\">早期计算</a> 与 <a href=\"computing-foundations/mechanizing-thought\">计算与科学的未来</a>（把技术放回时代与思想脉络）。</li>\n<li><strong>想先懂&quot;为什么是他&quot;</strong>：可先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 了解贝尔实验室背景，再回本卷。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些核心贡献，确立了汉明作为纠错码理论奠基人与计算科学先驱的地位。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-correcting-codes","title":"纠错码","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/error-correcting-codes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hamming-code","title":"汉明码","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-code"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hamming-distance","title":"海明距离","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"numerical-methods","title":"数值方法","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-analysis","title":"数值分析","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods/numerical-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hamming-window","title":"汉明窗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods/hamming-window"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"computing-foundations","title":"计算的奠基","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/computing-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-computing","title":"早期计算的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/computing-foundations/early-computing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mechanizing-thought","title":"计算与科学的未来","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/computing-foundations/mechanizing-thought"}]}]}